{"id":"22-5476-2-2","zh":"tvā 等的变化类","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-5477-2-11","zh":"下面讲 tvā、tvāna、tuna 的变化。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-5478-2-7","zh":"i、kara、hana。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-5479-2-7","zh":"758. 词根 i 之后变为 cca。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-5480-2-8","zh":"在词根 i 之后，tvā 可以变为 cca。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-5481-2-23","zh":"pecca、samecca、abhisamecca、avecca、anvecca、apecca、upecca、samupecca、adhicca、aticca、paṭicca。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-5482-2-4","zh":"为什么说“可以”？","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-5482-5-10","zh":"因为也有 upetvā、samupetvā、adhiyitvā 这样的形式。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-5483-2-28","zh":"759. 在 sa、adhi 之后的 kara 之后，变为 racca、riccā［ka.598；rū.643；nī.1203；多个版本作‘sāsādhikarā cacariccā’］。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-5484-2-16","zh":"在 santa、adhi、parā 之后的词根 kara 之后，tvā 可以变为 racca 或 riccā；这里也适用拆分规则（suttavibhatta）。","confidence":65}
{"id":"22-5485-2-11","zh":"例如 sakkacca；‘sakkaccaṃ’则是增加了鼻音（bindu）；又如 adhikicca。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-5486-2-4","zh":"为什么说“可以”？","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-5486-5-10","zh":"因为也有 sakkatvā、sakkaritvā、adhikaritvā 这样的形式。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-5487-2-18","zh":"依照拆分规则：attaṃ niraṃkacca piyāni sevati（抛开自己去追逐所爱的事物）［jā.2.21.461］；abhisaṅkhacca bhojanaṃ（准备好食物以后）。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-5488-2-28","zh":"760. 在 hana 之后变为 racca［ka.598；rū.643；nī.1203；多个版本作‘sāsādhikarā cacariccā’］。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-5489-2-8","zh":"在复合词中，词根 hana 之后的 tvā 可以变为 racca。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-5489-9-11","zh":"依照拆分规则，词根 hara 之后也是这样。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-5490-2-11","zh":"āhacca、uhacca、vihacca、saṃhacca、upahacca。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-5491-2-4","zh":"为什么说“可以”？","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-5491-5-12","zh":"因为也有 āhanitvā、uhanitvā、vihanitvā、saṃhanitvā 这样的形式。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-5492-2-22","zh":"hara 的例子：sā no āhacca poseti（她把东西带来养活我们）［jā.2.22.2334（作 āhatva）］；tato udakamāhacca（然后取来水）。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-5493-2-3","zh":"disa，意思是观看。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-5494-2-31","zh":"761. 在 disa 之后变为 vāna 和 vā，并且（词根的 s）变为 sa［ka.599；rū.644；nī.1204；多个版本作‘…sa ca’］。","confidence":65}
{"id":"22-5495-2-17","zh":"在词根 disa 之后，tvā 可以变为 vāna 或 vā，并且 disa 的 s 仍然是 s；这一条是为了阻止它同化为后面的字母。","confidence":65}
{"id":"22-5496-2-5","zh":"disvāna、disvā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-5497-2-4","zh":"为什么说“可以”？","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-5497-5-6","zh":"因为也有 passitvā 这样的形式。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-5498-2-27","zh":"khā、ñā、dā、dhā、hā、ki、khi、ci、ji、nī、lī、si、bhū。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-5499-2-39","zh":"按照‘在复合词中 tvā 可以变为 pya’这一条，tvā 变为 ya；再按照大规则（mahāvutti），可以选择性地在某些地方删去 ya。带前缀 saṃ 的 khā 意思是知道：saṅkhāya、saṅkhā、paṭisaṅkhāya、paṭisaṅkhā、aññāya、aññā、abhiññāya、abhiññā、pariññāya、pariññā。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-5500-2-4","zh":"为什么说“在复合词中”？","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-5500-5-6","zh":"因为非复合词作 ñatvā。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-5501-2-4","zh":"为什么说“可以”？","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-5501-5-10","zh":"因为也有 ājānitvā、abhijānitvā、parijānitvā 这样的形式。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-5502-2-9","zh":"adhiṭṭhāya、adhiṭṭhā、patiṭṭhāya、patiṭṭhā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-5503-2-4","zh":"为什么说“在复合词中”？","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-5503-5-6","zh":"因为非复合词作 ṭhatvā。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-5504-2-4","zh":"为什么说“可以”？","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-5504-5-8","zh":"因为也有 adhiṭṭhahitvā、patiṭṭhahitvā 这样的形式。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-5504-9-13","zh":"按照大规则变为 i：upaṭṭhitvā。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-5505-2-7","zh":"ādāya、upādāya、upādā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-5506-2-4","zh":"为什么说“在复合词中”？","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-5506-5-6","zh":"因为非复合词作 datvā。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-5507-2-4","zh":"为什么说“可以”？","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-5507-5-25","zh":"因为也有 ādiyitvā、samādiyitvā 这样的形式：按照‘ū byañjanassa’这一条增加 ī，再按照‘dāssiyaṅa’这条规则，在复合词中后面接元音时，（dā）替换为 iya。","confidence":65}
{"id":"22-5508-2-6","zh":"762. 变为 tuṃ 和 yāna。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-5509-2-9","zh":"在复合词中，tvā 有时变为 tuṃ 和 yāna。","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-5510-2-23","zh":"由于“多样适用”（bahula）这一管辖规则，在偈颂里非复合词也可以这样，例如：nekkhamaṃ daṭṭhu khemato（把出离看作安稳）［su.ni.426］；kimabbhutaṃ daṭṭhu marū pamoditā（诸天看到了什么稀有的事而欢喜）；这里删去了鼻音。","confidence":65}
{"id":"22-5511-2-17","zh":"abhihattuṃ pavāreyya（可以邀请他取用）；也有读作“abhihaṭuṃ”的，这是删去了复辅音的第一个辅音，并把 t 变为 ṭ。","confidence":65}
{"id":"22-5511-18-32","zh":"也有人读作“abhihaṭṭhuṃ”［pāci.2.243］。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-5511-33-36","zh":"但这种读法的辅音对不上。","confidence":65}
{"id":"22-5512-2-5","zh":"ādiyāna、upādiyāna。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-5512-6-23","zh":"vidhāya、nidhāya、sandhāya、odhāya、samodhāya、vidahitvā、nidahitvā、odahitvā、samodahitvā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-5512-24-33","zh":"pahāya、vihāya、ohāya、hitvā、jahitvā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-5513-2-9","zh":"在以 i 类元音结尾的词根中，pya 要双写：vikkiyya；另有 vikkiṇitvā。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-5514-2-37","zh":"viceyya dānaṃ dātabbaṃ（应当拣选之后再布施）［pe.va.329］，这是按照‘ūlasse’这一条把 i 变为 e；又有 vicinitvā、vineyya、vinetvā、vinayitvā、allīya、allīyitvā、paṭisallīya、paṭisallīyitvā，这里增加了 y。","confidence":65}
{"id":"22-5515-2-20","zh":"763. 在 pya 之前，si 变为 ā［ka.517；rū.488；nī.1105］。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-5516-2-7","zh":"后面接 pya 时，si（的元音）可以变为 ā。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-5517-2-13","zh":"nissāya、upanissāya、apassāya、apassayitvā、avassāya、avassayitvā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-5518-2-4","zh":"为什么说“可以”？","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-5518-5-8","zh":"因为也有 adhisetvā、adhisayitvā 这样的形式。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-5519-2-17","zh":"bhū，意思是存在；（元音）变短：sambhuyya、vibhuyya、anubhuyya、adhibhuyya、paribhuyya、abhibhuyya。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-5520-2-5","zh":"为什么说“在复合词中”？","confidence":85}
{"id":"22-5520-6-24","zh":"因为非复合词作 bhutvā。在以 e 结尾的词根中，按照大规则把 e 变为 ā：nijjhāya、nijjhāyitvā、upanijjhāya、upanijjhāyitvā、abhijjhāya、abhijjhāyitvā。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-5521-2-16","zh":"在以辅音结尾的词根中，按照‘vaggalalehi te’这条规则，在 c 组、p 组辅音和 s 之后，y 同化为前面的辅音。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-5521-17-38","zh":"在 t 组辅音中，按照‘tavaggavaraṇānaṃ ye cavaggabayañā’这一条，t 组变为 c 组，然后 y 同化为前面的辅音：vipacca、paripacca、vimucca、adhimucca。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-5522-2-20","zh":"按照大规则，删去 y 并且元音变长：āpucchā、anāpucchā、vibhajja、saṃvibhajja、visajja、nisajja、paṭinisajja。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-5523-2-11","zh":"ujjha，意思是舍弃；删去 y：ujjha、ujjhiya、ujjhitvā。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-5524-2-11","zh":"kati，意思是切割：kacca、vikacca、kantitvā、vikantitvā。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-5525-2-15","zh":"nikara，意思是欺骗：nikacca kitavasseva（就像赌徒行骗那样）［saṃ.ni.1.35］。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-5526-2-11","zh":"pata，意思是行进（落下）：pacca、nipacca、patitvā、nipatitvā。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-5527-2-5","zh":"katha，意思是说话：sākaccha。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-5528-2-17","zh":"pada，意思是行进：pajja、āpajja、nipajja、vipajja、sampajja、upasampajja、paṭipajja。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-5529-2-32","zh":"按照‘ū byañjanassa’增加 ī 之后，再按照‘padādīnaṃ yuka’这一条增加 y，并同化为前面的辅音：pajjiya、pajjiyāna、āpajjiya、āpajjiyāna、nipajjiya、vipajjiya、sampajjiya、paṭipajjiya。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-5530-2-16","zh":"带前缀 ā 的 sada，意思是碰撞：āsajja naṃ tathāgataṃ（冒犯那位如来）［itivu.89］；kākova selamāsajja（就像乌鸦去撞岩石）。","confidence":70}
{"id":"22-5530-17-46","zh":"chejja、chijja、chindiya、acchijja、acchindiya、vicchijja、vicchindiya、paricchijja、paricchindiya、bhejja、bhijja、sambhijja、paṭisambhijja、bhindiya、sambhindiya。","confidence":90}
{"id":"22-5531-2-33","zh":"budha，意思是觉知：bujjha、sambujjha、abhisambujjha、bujjhiya、bujjhiyāna；经文中有“marīcikūpamaṃ abhisambuddhāno”（觉悟到它像阳焰一样），这是在替换为 dā 时把 a 变为 o 而形成的，就像‘anupādiyāno’一样。","confidence":50}
{"id":"22-5532-2-8","zh":"vadha，意思是伤害：vajjha、vajjhiya。","confidence":80}
{"id":"22-5533-2-7","zh":"vidha，意思是刺穿：vijjha、vijjhiya。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-5534-2-10","zh":"khana，意思是挖掘：khañña、khaṇiya，这里 n 变为 ṇ。","confidence":75}
{"id":"22-5535-2-3","zh":"在 p 组辅音中——","confidence":75}
